@startuml
title Order Status State

[*] --> Pending
state choicePoint <<choice>>
Pending --> choicePoint : Restaurant reviews
choicePoint --> Confirmed : [in stock]
choicePoint --> Cancelled : [out of stock / restaurant cancels]

Pending --> Cancelled : Customer cancels
Confirmed --> Cancelled : Customer cancels
Confirmed --> Preparing : Restaurant starts preparation
Preparing --> For_Pickup : Restaurant tags for pickup
For_Pickup --> Received : Customer confirms handoff

Received --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml